---
import BaseLayout from '@shared/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service';
const description = 'Terms of using TextKDP. The short version: results are estimates; you accept the site as-is and are responsible for your own decisions.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} pathname="/terms/" schemaType="WebPage">
  <article class="prose-like max-w-3xl space-y-4">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: 2026-10-15</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Use at your own risk</h2>
    <p>TextKDP's tools provide results based on the inputs you enter, using common conventions for word counting, sentence detection, and Latin filler text. They are not legal, academic, or professional editorial advice. Word and character counts are estimates that may differ slightly from a target editor (e.g., Microsoft Word's hyphen-handling); always verify against the platform that will accept your work for high-stakes assignments.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">No warranty</h2>
    <p>The site is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement. We do not warrant that counts, formatting, or generated text are error-free.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, TextKDP and its operators are not liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the site or reliance on its outputs.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">External links</h2>
    <p>Pages may contain links to third-party sites. We do not endorse or vouch for the products or content of third parties.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>The site's design, code, and original written content are © TextKDP / Kdp.Cool. Lorem Ipsum filler text is in the public domain.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site means you accept the current terms.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Contact</h2>
    <p>See <a href="/contact/" class="text-violet-600 hover:underline">Contact</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
